    "info": "Clone of SITL 17 adapted to ArduCopter sysid 1 on the default Docker lab AP port pair.\n\nFlow: Arm (COMMAND_LONG) -> Takeoff (COMMAND_LONG) -> delay -> DO_REPOSITION (COMMAND_INT, MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_RELATIVE_ALT = 3).\n\nPrerequisite: put ArduCopter in GUIDED before firing this chain, or insert your own GUIDED setup flow first. The goto target is near the common AP Canberra home, about 100 m north of -35.36, 149.16, with a relative-altitude z value.",
